#: fonts.cpp:206
msgid "Configure Anti-Alias Settings"
msgstr "Kantstreken instellen"

#: fonts.cpp:212
msgid "E&xclude range:"
msgstr "Rebeet ut&sluten:"

#: fonts.cpp:215 fonts.cpp:220
msgid " pt"
msgstr " pt"

#: fonts.cpp:217
msgid " to "
msgstr " bet "

#: fonts.cpp:223
msgid "&Use sub-pixel hinting:"
msgstr "Subpixel-&Hinting bruken:"

#: fonts.cpp:226
msgid ""
"If you have a TFT or LCD screen you can further improve the quality of "
"displayed fonts by selecting this option."
"<br>Sub-pixel hinting is also known as ClearType(tm)."
"<br>"
"<br><b>This will not work with CRT monitors.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du en TFT- oder LCD-Schirm bruukst, kannst Du de Gööd vun de "
"Schriftdorstellen verbetern, wenn Du dit aktiveerst.\n"
"<br>Subpixel-Hinting warrt ok \"ClearType(TM)\" nöömt."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Op Röhrenmonitoren hölpt dat nich.</b>"

#: fonts.cpp:234
msgid ""
"In order for sub-pixel hinting to work correctly you need to know how the "
"sub-pixels of your display are aligned."
"<br> On TFT or LCD displays a single pixel is actually composed of three "
"sub-pixels, red, green and blue. Most displays have a linear ordering of RGB "
"sub-pixel, some have BGR."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dat Subpixel-Hinting funkscheneren schall, muttst Du weten, wodennig de "
"Subpixels vun Dien Schirm anornt sünd."
"<br>Op TFT- un LCD-Schirmen is dat enkelte Pixel ut dree Subpixels opbuut, "
"jümmers een för Root, Gröön un Blaag. De mehrsten Schirmen bruukt ok disse Reeg "
"(RGB), man en poor bruukt ok Blaag, Gröön, Root (BGR)."

#: fonts.cpp:245
msgid "Hinting style: "
msgstr "Hinting-Stil:"

#: fonts.cpp:252
msgid ""
"Hinting is a process used to enhance the quality of fonts at small sizes."
msgstr ""
"Vele Schriftdateien bargt Informatschonen (\"Hints\"), de besünners för lütte "
"Schriftgrötten de Dorstellen verbetert. \"Hinting\" bruukt disse "
"Informatschonen."

